      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "On PC you can already do this, but having it in-client would be great.\n\nCreate an instance of a world on VRChat's website, enter the weblink and right-click on \"Launch World\" and \"Copy Link\". Find VRChat on steam, go to properties and paste it in the launch options field.\n\nEveryone with the same launch parameter will launch directly in the same instance when booting up the game.",
