  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-04-18T17:46:34.728Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It would be cool to have the option to share a home world with a friend or two, or even a group, so that when you all log in, you are already together in one home world instead of requesting or joining off the other to get in the same room. Could be a lot of fun!",
